we are going to bring up Wordpress with docker compose file

if we want the worldpress work currectly we need to docker container 
   1-mysql-db
   2-worldpress

to setup docker-compose type this command: 
    docker compose up -d

to shutdown our docker container 
    docker compose down 

to shutdown our docker container and remove volume 
   docker compose down -v

if we want to check our mysql db
   docker compose exec -it db /bin/bash
      then mysql -u worldpress -p  

if we want to check logs 
   docker compose logs db
   docker compose logs worldpress
